ws/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Yantis%20screams%2C%20fighting%20all,in%20front%20of%20him.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e8","summary":"Wothis shoves the investor into the river and jumps in as the crate smashes; Merret fears House Dimir will erase him.","participants":["grimbly-wothis","merret","house-dimir"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":374,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":42,"quote":"Nope, there's nothing covert about ruining a thousand zinos worth of cargo.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Nope%2C%20there%27s%20nothing%20covert,zinos%20worth%20of%20cargo.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Nope%2C%20there%27s%20nothing%20covert,zinos%20worth%20of%20cargo.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e10","summary":"Wothis breaks into the apartment, beats Merret and demands the child, saying he saw the candle trick through the window.","participants":["grimbly-wothis","merret","tashi","merret-s-baby"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":374,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":51,"quote":"I saw what that child did through the window